    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bloxpath</strong> \u2014 a puzzle game centered around <i>rolling blocks</i>, inspired by the classic Flash game Bloxorz. If you love pure puzzle challenges or are tired of the monotony of pushing boxes, this game will bring you a whole new level of fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wealth of Puzzles to Solve</strong>: Includes <strong>approximately 200 meticulously designed puzzles</strong> and <strong>over 20 unique gameplay mechanics</strong>, featuring a large map divided into regions. Each region offers puzzles with distinct styles, challenging different aspects of your thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Core Mechanics</strong>: From simple block rolling to complex multi-block interactions, the gameplay progresses layer by layer, continuously sparking your curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tree-like Unlocking System</strong>: Puzzles are unlocked in a tree structure, allowing you to switch to other regions for exploration when stuck, keeping the game flow uninterrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Experience</strong>: Supports keyboard, mouse, and controller inputs, with input buffering and configurable repeat input delays to ensure smooth and fluid controls, letting you focus on solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Loading, Seamless Transitions</strong>: Except for the initial launch, the game has no loading screens throughout, with all scenes and animations switching in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Performance Optimization</strong>: With vertical sync turned off, the frame rate is fully unlocked, allowing players with high-refresh-rate monitors to enjoy the ultimate smoothness of block rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Delight</strong>: The game is themed around blocks, with natural and smooth state transition animations and meticulously polished level transition effects, satisfying the aesthetic needs of OCD players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=516 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Design Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When creating Bloxpath, my goal was to immerse players in the pure joy of puzzle-solving without being bogged down by cumbersome rules. Here are my core principles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Not Overwhelming</strong>: Puzzles are designed to be concise and efficient, avoiding lengthy steps, with a moderate difficulty level suitable for players with puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: Early puzzles help you get familiar with the mechanics, while later ones challenge your inspiration and insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Approaches</strong>: Puzzles in different regions have unique solutions, allowing you to experience a variety of puzzle-solving fun rather than a single routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=526 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a programmer, I am almost obsessive in my pursuit of performance and experience. Bloxpath is not just a puzzle game; it is my dedication to detail. From seamless scene transitions to smooth controls, every aspect has been crafted with care. I hope you find the thrill of puzzle-solving in the game and enjoy every &quot;aha&quot; moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tired of pushing boxes? Come roll some blocks and give your brain a new challenge!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/9398bf94117720e23c4fd5e650a8d17f.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Bloxpath</strong> \u2014 a puzzle game centered around <i>rolling blocks</i>, inspired by the classic Flash game Bloxorz. If you love pure puzzle challenges or are tired of the monotony of pushing boxes, this game will bring you a whole new level of fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wealth of Puzzles to Solve</strong>: Includes <strong>approximately 200 meticulously designed puzzles</strong> and <strong>over 20 unique gameplay mechanics</strong>, featuring a large map divided into regions. Each region offers puzzles with distinct styles, challenging different aspects of your thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Core Mechanics</strong>: From simple block rolling to complex multi-block interactions, the gameplay progresses layer by layer, continuously sparking your curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tree-like Unlocking System</strong>: Puzzles are unlocked in a tree structure, allowing you to switch to other regions for exploration when stuck, keeping the game flow uninterrupted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/87b815f672bd6a63c79647949bb7dc06.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Experience</strong>: Supports keyboard, mouse, and controller inputs, with input buffering and configurable repeat input delays to ensure smooth and fluid controls, letting you focus on solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zero Loading, Seamless Transitions</strong>: Except for the initial launch, the game has no loading screens throughout, with all scenes and animations switching in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Performance Optimization</strong>: With vertical sync turned off, the frame rate is fully unlocked, allowing players with high-refresh-rate monitors to enjoy the ultimate smoothness of block rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Delight</strong>: The game is themed around blocks, with natural and smooth state transition animations and meticulously polished level transition effects, satisfying the aesthetic needs of OCD players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=516 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/8477a8e03486c1dc47fd1043a6d1ff3a.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Design Philosophy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When creating Bloxpath, my goal was to immerse players in the pure joy of puzzle-solving without being bogged down by cumbersome rules. Here are my core principles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but Not Overwhelming</strong>: Puzzles are designed to be concise and efficient, avoiding lengthy steps, with a moderate difficulty level suitable for players with puzzle experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong>: Early puzzles help you get familiar with the mechanics, while later ones challenge your inspiration and insight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Approaches</strong>: Puzzles in different regions have unique solutions, allowing you to experience a variety of puzzle-solving fun rather than a single routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/1aac694026274bbac9e4873499dd6128.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.poster.avif?t=1748966697\" width=526 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.webm?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249900/extras/b5bba223c5fa49ab1c67173e7451ff46.mp4?t=1748966697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Word from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a programmer, I am almost obsessive in my pursuit of performance and experience. Bloxpath is not just a puzzle game; it is my dedication to detail. From seamless scene transitions to smooth controls, every aspect has been crafted with care. I hope you find the thrill of puzzle-solving in the game and enjoy every &quot;aha&quot; moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tired of pushing boxes? Come roll some blocks and give your brain a new challenge!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
